Package: i2pd
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}, adduser
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends}, openssl
Recommends: ca-certificates, logrotate
Suggests: apparmor, i2pd-tui, libio-socket-ssl-perl
Description: C++ I2P router (openi2pd)
 openi2pd is an independent fork of i2pd, a full-featured C++ implementation of
 an I2P client. I2P (Invisible Internet Protocol) is a universal anonymous
 network layer. All communications over I2P are anonymous and end-to-end
 encrypted, participants don't reveal their real IP addresses.
 .
 This package contains the router, command-line tools, configuration files,
 certificates, documentation, AppArmor profile and service integration.

Package: i2pd-tui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, i2pd (= ${binary:Version})
Description: ncurses TUI for the openi2pd router
 Local terminal user interface for monitoring and controlling the openi2pd
 router over its local IPC channel.
